CHECK a2.toolbar.undo-changes-document PASS VEdit application shell — demo editor pane #1

This text view is the shell's placeholder editor. The real editor
widget is injected by src/editor (edit-core) through the
EditorProvider seam; nothing in the shell depends on KTextEditor.

Layout operations worth trying:
  * Ctrl+Shift+H  split horizontally (side by side)
  * Ctrl+Shift+V  split vertically (stacked)
  * F6            focus the next pane
  * Ctrl+W        close the focused pane
  * View menu     insert / hide the panel docks on demand

